This folder is intentionally empty.

JianeTech.Api serves the Blazor console (JianeTech.Client) from this host, and the
client's own wwwroot is composed into this one through static web assets at build
time. ASP.NET Core still needs the folder to exist to resolve a web root at all —
without it, startup warns "The WebRootPath was not found" and static files are served
from a null provider.

Put nothing here: assets belong in JianeTech.Client/wwwroot.
